flowchart TD
    I[IFC bytes and schema] --> S[Source digest and model version]
    S --> E[Version-scoped element IDs and IFC GlobalIds]
    E --> Q[Quantity and material records]
    Q --> L[Allocation links and measured operations]
    T[Approved zone and method templates] --> L
    L --> W[Work packages and activities]
    W --> D[Demand by trade and equipment]
    C[Versioned catalogue coefficients] --> D
    D --> P[Productive time plus separate release constraints]
    P --> G[Validated schedule and CPM result]
    A[Calendar and real progress] --> G
    G --> F[Scenarios with cost carbon and coverage]
    R[Old and new versions plus reviewed identity] --> L
    F --> X[Selected schedule to task and product IFC mapping]
    X --> Z[Derived IFC and round-trip report]

